OL,3,GNEWSAMinister says new office space
OL,4,A'vital' for island
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe planning minister and a commercial
OL,7,Festate agent have insisted there is a
OL,8,Fneed for new offices in Jersey, despite
OL,9,Fconcerns from a campaign group.
OL,11,FD2 Real Estate (D2RE) director Chris
OL,12,FDaniels said demand was "outweighing
OL,13,Fsupply".
OL,15,FHaving approved a seven-storey office
OL,16,Fblock at 19-21 Esplanade, the Planning
OL,17,FMinister Senator Sir Mark Boleat said
OL,18,Fdevelopers would never build offices
OL,19,Funless they could attract tenants and
OL,20,Fsaid new spaces were "vital".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
