OL,3,GNEWSAMinister says new office space
OL,4,A'vital' for island
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigner Judith Queree questioned
OL,7,Fwhether there was still as much demand
OL,8,Fas artificial intelligence was adopted
OL,9,Fmore in the workplace and people worked
OL,10,Fremotely.
